VAR { trace capture staging -- filled by eventCapture() / the FAULTB and OVERSHT trials, read by their finish }

    LONG    cpWhy                                           ' WHY_* the trace is not the requested event, NONE when it is
    LONG    cpEnd                                           ' TEND_* naming why the capture ended
